@startuml
title SecureSync - diagrama de componente
skinparam componentStyle uml2

node "Browser" {
  component "Documente\nReact + oidc-client-ts\nlocalhost:3001" as Documents
  component "Portal\nReact + oidc-client-ts\nlocalhost:3002" as Portal
}
node "Docker Compose" {
  component "Keycloak 26.8.2\nRealm securesync" as Keycloak
  database "PostgreSQL 16\nidentitati si sesiuni" as IdentityDb
  component "API Spring Boot 3.5.8\nJava 21" as Api {
    component "Resource server\nJWT local / introspectie" as Security
    component "Politica\nscope -> rol -> proprietar/departament" as Policy
    component "Serviciu documente" as DocumentService
    component "Administrare membri\nIMPLEMENTATOR + members:manage\nrol curent verificat online" as Members
  }
  database "PostgreSQL 16\nmetadate documente" as DocumentsDb
  artifact "Volum PDF privat\nfara ruta publica" as Pdf
}
component "Experiment Python 3.12+\nmeasure.py / analyze.py" as Experiment

Documents --> Keycloak : Authorization Code + PKCE S256
Portal --> Keycloak : Authorization Code + PKCE / SSO
Documents --> Security : REST + Bearer token
Portal --> Security : REST + Bearer token
Security --> Keycloak : JWKS / introspectie per cerere
Security --> Policy : identitate validata
Security --> Members : identitate validata + scope / rol
Members --> Keycloak : Admin REST cu client tehnic separat
Policy --> DocumentService : acces permis
DocumentService --> DocumentsDb : JPA / JDBC
DocumentService --> Pdf : citire / scriere
Keycloak --> IdentityDb : JDBC
Experiment --> Keycloak : PKCE si Admin API: revocare sid
Experiment --> Security : cereri cu acelasi token
@enduml
